<p>Do you like Java and want to be up-to-date with the latest features? You can also read my <a href="https://piotrminkowski.com/2021/02/01/new-developer-friendly-features-after-java-8/">article</a> about new features after Java 8. Below, you can find a list of eight unknown and useful described in the current article. Let’s begin!</p>


